      "id": "karrio",
      "title": "Karrio",
      "url": "https://github.com/karrioapi/karrio",
      "source_type": "implementation",
      "license": "LGPL-3.0",
      "retrieved": "2026-09-27",
      "version": "deea10f8568b2d48c71bbcc11ec11c62cdaf2a6a",
      "local_path": "sources/domains/karrio/source",
      "notes": "reference-only (LGPL). Multi-carrier shipping API/platform. Cloned modules/manager (Address, Parcel, Commodity, Pickup, Tracking, Shipment, DocumentUploadRecord, Manifest models + PickupStatus/ShipmentStatus/TrackerStatus enums in modules/core), and modules/orders (Order model, OrderStatus). The ee/ directory (commercial add-ons, under separate LICENSE_EE) and the rating/providers/connectors modules were not cloned."
    },
