      "retrieved": "2026-09-27",
      "version": "4ff6980c6db6f3e8103b3ec425a089aa6d251af4",
      "local_path": "sources/domains/fleetbase/source",
      "notes": "reference-only (AGPL). Fleet operations / last-mile dispatch platform. Full DB schema inspected via the repo's own generated database.mmd (Mermaid ERD): orders, payloads, waypoints, routes, drivers, vehicles, fleets, manifests, tracking_statuses, issues, maintenance_schedules/maintenances, service_rates/quotes, places, zones. Application code beyond the schema was not deeply inspected in this pass."
    }
